H-EXT4-02: MacWilliams transform of extended [6,3,4] hexacode
  Hexacode is self-dual over GF(4)
  Weight enumerator: W(x,y) = x^6 + 45*x^2*y^4 + 18*y^6
  Self-dual => dual weight enumerator = original
  A_4 + A_6 = 45 + 18 = 63
  = q^k - 1 = 63
  A_4 : A_6 = 45:18 = 5/2
